# Variant a — the frontier model alone at low effort, for every untagged (mid) step.
# The baseline Anthropic's cost guide says any pairing has to beat. Tagged steps keep their
# tier, so a `model: strong` step is identical under a and b.
# Protocol and decision rule: scripts/plan-runner/benchmark.md
MODEL_MID=fable
EFFORT_MID=low
ADVISOR_MID=
JUDGE_MODEL=opus
JUDGE_EFFORT=high
